@startuml
participant "Spring Boot服务端" as Server
database MySQL
activate Server
Server -> Server: 订单扫描任务开始
Server -> Server: 查询所有待接单订单
Server -> Server: 遍历订单列表
loop 订单列表
    Server -> Server: 计算订单时间与当前时间的差值
    alt 订单超时
        Server -> Server: 取消订单
        Server -> Server: 归还用户金额
        Server -> Server: 记录收支明细
    else 订单未超时
        Server -> Server: 继续扫描下一个订单
    end
end
deactivate Server
Server -> Server: 订单扫描任务结束
@enduml
